  "_comment": "OWNER'S FIRST DUNGEON, authored as a pure room GRAPH (no hand-typed coords). GraphDungeonComposer instantiates each prefab, reads the real RoomSocket transforms, and solves every room's world pose by mating sockets door-to-door. Junction is Intersection (4-way) NOT TJunction: the owner's junction needs entry(S) + left + right + straight = 4 openings, and the built TJunction prefab only has S/E/W (no north), so it cannot carry a straight-through. The 3 TurnRight rooms make the straight branch bend N->E->S->W into a rectangular loop whose final open door dead-ends next to the junction (no closing edge - a returning dead-end). Add a room = add one node + one edge.",
